  "rules": {
    "CONSTRUCTION": {"title":"Construction","content":"An SCV constructs ordinary Terran buildings. Engineering Bay uses Command Center tech; a lowered Depot satisfies Depot tech. A grounded production building needs free space to its right to construct an add-on. Add-ons are local attachments, not global unlocks. Lift/land can transfer an existing add-on between compatible production buildings. A Reactor cannot train a unit that requires a Tech Lab."},
    "PRODUCTION": {"title":"Production","content":"Reactor production is available only to compatible units without a Tech Lab requirement. Hellion ↔ Hellbat transformation requires Armory tech; Tank, Viking, Liberator, Widow Mine, and Thor mode changes reuse the existing unit rather than purchase a second unit."},
